<title>MALAYSIA: Ngiu Kee stock debuts at 6.30 rgt.</title>
<headline>Ngiu Kee stock debuts at 6.30 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of Ngiu Kee Corp (Malaysia) Bhd made its market debut at 6.30 ringgit against an offer price of 2.60 ringgit.</p>
<p>Around six minutes into trading the stock was at 6.65 ringgit on volume of 602,000 shares traded.  </p>
<p>Ngiu Kee, which operates departmental stores and supermarkets, is listed on the second board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company recorded net profit of 5.89 million ringgit and earnings per share (EPS) of 25.3 cents for the year ended December 31, 1996, on turnover of 135.99 million ringgit.</p>
<p>For the 1997 year, the company has forecast net earnings pf 6.23 million ringgit and EPS of 33.8 cents.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
